1
00:00:00,220 --> 00:00:02,750
(Amy:)Well, there was the time
I had my tonsils out,

2
00:00:02,750 --> 00:00:05,490
(Amy:)and I shared a room with
a little Vietnamese girl.

3
00:00:06,660 --> 00:00:08,030
(Amy:)She didn't make it
through the night,

4
00:00:08,030 --> 00:00:10,190
(Amy:)but up till then,
it was kind of fun.

5
00:00:12,830 --> 00:00:15,830
(Penny:)Okay. Well, I guess we're
having a slumber party.

6
00:00:15,830 --> 00:00:17,200
(Penny:)Oh!

7
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:21,110
(Amy:)Pillow fight!

8
00:00:23,780 --> 00:00:26,440
(Leonard:)Oh, I hope they
let us in soon.

9
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:28,880
(Leonard:)I'm tired of running to the gas
station to use the bathroom.

10
00:00:28,880 --> 00:00:32,180
(Leonard:)The guy makes me buy
a Gatorade every time.

11
00:00:32,180 --> 00:00:33,480
(Leonard:)It's a vicious circle.

12
00:00:33,490 --> 00:00:37,560
(Howard:)Too bad you don't have
a stadium pal like me.

13
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:38,920
(Leonard:)What's a stadium pal?

14
00:00:38,920 --> 00:00:40,460
Let me put it this way:

15
00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:42,330
(Howard:)takes care of
the bathroom problem,

16
00:00:42,330 --> 00:00:44,060
(Howard:)and it keeps your calf warm.

17
00:00:45,260 --> 00:00:48,330
(Raj:)Hey, guys, bad news.
I just did a quick calculation.

18
00:00:48,330 --> 00:00:50,900
Given the size of the theater
and the length of this line,

19
00:00:50,900 --> 00:00:52,800
(Raj:)we might not get seats.

20
00:00:53,710 --> 00:00:55,940
(Sheldon:)What did he say?

21
00:00:55,940 --> 00:00:57,140
(Leonard:)Nice going, Raj.

22
00:00:57,140 --> 00:01:00,020
(Leonard:)Just got him down for his nap.

